Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?book=20ch.16=20part=202:=20covariates=20and=20b?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ackward=20selection=20in=20mixed=20models=20(16.7=E2=80=9316.8)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- mixed_model: optional covariate (with its own transformation) crossed
  with the fixed factors (LogSeedbank*Year*Treatment), backward selection
  by marginal approximate F-tests with REML refit at every step
  (Table 16.8), predictions at the covariate mean, percentage variance
  accounted for from the null-model variance components (Example 16.2).
- Variance-component SEs from the average-information matrix, as in
  GenStat (identical to the expected information for balanced designs).
- Tests against Tables 16.8, 16.9 and Example 16.2.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01A2hqwsyFif9SnDnzK8co2e
